<title>USA: Travelers to redeem $300 mln of pref shrs.</title>
<headline>Travelers to redeem $300 mln of pref shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Travelers Group said Friday it will redeem all 1.2 million of its 8.125 percent cumulative preferred stock series A on July 28 for $250 per share plus accrued and unpaid dividends.</p>
</text>
